  message: "Fixed by PR (pending): linkers/websocket.py now uses canonical make_file_id shape and derives language from file extension via _text_filters.language_from_path, with dedup against ctx.symbols. The 3 duplicate file Symbols on self-analysis (test_websocket.py, serve.py, ws-client.ts) should drop to 0. Quantitative claim: 3 → 0 phantom file Symbols on self-analysis; awaits bakeoff to confirm no broader regressions."  # 8c7e
